WEBVTT

00:09:58.542 --> 00:10:01.255
because they liked it
a little better than number four.

00:10:01.764 --> 00:10:05.375
Sometime later -- it could be
15 minutes, it could be 15 days --

00:10:05.399 --> 00:10:07.470
the same stimuli are put
before the subject,

00:10:07.494 --> 00:10:10.033
and the subject is asked
to re-rank the stimuli.

00:10:10.057 --> 00:10:12.207
"Tell us how much you like them now."

00:10:12.231 --> 00:10:13.437
What happens?

00:10:13.461 --> 00:10:15.346
Watch as happiness is synthesized.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.565
This is the result that's been replicated
over and over again.

00:10:18.589 --> 00:10:20.580
You're watching happiness be synthesized.

00:10:20.604 --> 00:10:22.096
Would you like to see it again?

00:10:23.023 --> 00:10:24.176
Happiness!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.602
"The one I got is really
better than I thought!

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:29.165
That other one I didn't get sucks!"

00:10:29.189 --> 00:10:30.950
That's the synthesis of happiness.